  "question": {
    "text": "The sides of a right-angled triangle are in arithmetic progression. If the triangle has area 24 square units, then what is the length of its smallest side?"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let three sides of triangle be: <math><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"italic\"> a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"italic\"> a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></math>.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0010_bd614ffe9ec0.jpg\"/></p><p>Where, <math><mi>d</mi><mo>></mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>a</mi><mo>></mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p><math><mo>⇒</mo></math>  length of smallest side <math><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></math> units</p><p>Now,  <math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mrow><mo>(</mo> <mrow> <mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi> </mrow> <mo>)</mo></mrow> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>=</mo><msup> <mi>a</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo><msup> <mrow> <mrow><mo>(</mo> <mrow> <mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi> </mrow> <mo>)</mo></mrow> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math></p><p><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>∴</mo><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>d</mi></math>        .....(i)</p><p>(As <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo> </mo><mo>=</mo><mo> </mo><mn>0</mn></math> is rejected)</p><p>Also,    <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>a</mi><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn></math>        .....(ii)</p><p><math><mo>∴</mo></math>     From (i) and (ii), we get  <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Hence, length of smallest side is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>units</p>"
  }
}